[5071]="7002AC4C\n1\tBring the mayor something to relieve him (total: 6)\tItems that might help to relieve the mayor's discomfort can be found throughout the Farmers Faire area. You should collect an item that will help to soothe the mayor's requests. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tSpeak with Mayor Whitfoot\tMayor Whitfoot can be found at the Farmers Faire in Bywater. You should speak with Mayor Whitfoot.\n",
