[5081]="70000020\n1\tFollow Veronica to the \"Black Rider\"\tOdovacar Bolger has lent you the services of his hound, Veronica, to track down the mysterious \"Black Rider\". He told you to follow Veronica wherever she lead, and she would find the trespasser.\n2\tShow black cloak to Greta Fallohide\tGreta Fallohide is in Budgeford. Veronica has led you to Greta Fallohide. Could she be the mysterious \"Black Rider?\"\n3\tTalk to Fogo Fallohide\tFogo Fallohide can be found at The Golden Perch in Stock, south-east of Budgeford. Odovacar's Bolger's hound, Veronica, led you to Greta Fallohide, who told you she made the cloak for her nephew, Fogo. Fogo Fallohide is very likely the \"Black Rider\". You should seek him out.\n4\tTalk to Odovacar Bolger\tOdovacar Bolger can be found at his home in the centre of Budgeford north of his pig sties. You should return to Odovacar Bolger and let him know what you learned about the \"Black Rider.\"\n",
[5082]="700717E2\n1\tSpeak with Irsinith\tIrsinith wishes to tell you more about Amûma and her duty as her warden.\n2\tSpeak with Irsinith\tIrsinith told you about Amûma and her duty as her warden, she wishes to speak with you again.\n",
[5083]="70071761\n1\tLearn about Adagím from Tálbiral\tSpeak with Tálbiral to learn about the the Pale Blight's impact on Adagím and how the Kintai are trying to fight it.\n2\tLearn about Adagím from Tálbiral\tSpeak with Tálbiral to learn about the the Pale Blight's impact on Adagím and how the Kintai are trying to fight it.\n3\tSpeak with Tálbiral\tSpeak with Tálbiral to learn about the the Pale Blight's impact on Adagím and how the Kintai are trying to fight it.\n",
[5084]="70071775\n1\tSpeak with Dáthlil to learn more about the scout's report\tDáthlil has received a scout's report that they have had strange sightings to the south and they believe they have located the source of the Pale Blight.\n2\tSpeak with Dáthlil\tYou have defeated the morroval that attacked you near the ruins of Nagakhêdi and is believe to be the source of the Pale Blight. Speak with Dáthlil about your success.\n",
[5085]="7007175F\n1\tInspect blighted trees in Laivárth (total: 3)\tTálbiral has asked for your help with checking trees within Laivárth for signs of rot so that they can be cleansed.\n2\tSpeak with Tálbiral\tYou found trees that have been infected by the Pale Blight within Laivárth. Return to Tálbiral so he knows to cleanse them from the grove.\n",
[5086]="70071760\n1\tReach blight area\tTálbiral has asked that you check the area surrounding Laivárth and inspect blighted areas to learn more about it.\n2\tInspect samples (total: 2)\tTálbiral has asked that you check the area surrounding Laivárth and inspect blighted areas to learn more about it.\n3\tReach blight area\tTálbiral has asked that you check the area surrounding Laivárth and inspect blighted areas to learn more about it.\n4\tInspect samples (total: 2)\tTálbiral has asked that you check the area surrounding Laivárth and inspect blighted areas to learn more about it.\n5\tReach blight area\tTálbiral has asked that you check the area surrounding Laivárth and inspect blighted areas to learn more about it.\n6\tInspect samples (total: 3)\tTálbiral has asked that you check the area surrounding Laivárth and inspect blighted areas to learn more about it.\n7\tReturn to Tálbiral\tYou have inspected the blight surrounding Laivárth. Return to Tálbiral with the information you gathered.\n",
[5087]="70071766\n1\tFind Irsinith at the Hill of the Mother\tTálbiral has asked you to find and speak with Irsinith at the Hill of the Mother. She will want to know about how the Pale Blight is consuming Laivárth.\n2\tSpeak to Irsinith at the Hill of the Mother\tYou found Irsinith at the Hill of the Mother. Speak with her about the Pale Blight and how Laivárth is being consumed by it.\n",
[5088]="70071770\n1\tGather sap from Amûma (total: 5)\tIrsinith has asked you to gather sap from the trunk of the mother tree and return it to her so that she can show you how the Pale Blight is rotting within.\n2\tBring the sap from the mother tree to Irsinith\tYou have gathered sap from Amûma. Return to Irsinith with it so that she can show you the signs of the Pale Blight.\n",
